WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.834
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.200
You're here. You made it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.033
We've got a full crowd,
a full house.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.601
Well, guys, it was just reported

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.601
that the other day a plane
carrying former president Trump

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:15.801
suffered an engine failure
over the Gulf of Mexico

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:18.767
and had to make an emergency
landing in New Orleans.

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.400
Yeah, when Trump said,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.767
"Land over there,"
the pilot was like,

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:24.334
"We can't. There's half
a built wall in the way."

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:25.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:28.000
Oops.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.467
And following the plane scare,

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:31.234
Trump sent out
a fundraising e-mail

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:33.567
to his supporters
asking for money

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:36.300
so he can buy a new
"Trump Force One" airplane.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:40.200
That's right.
Trump wants a new plane

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.033
because the only thing
scarier than a crash

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:44.601
is flying commercial.

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:47.434
But in all seriousness, James,
can you play me some music?

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:48.968
Some piano?

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:51.734
[ Dramatic piano music plays ]

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:54.767
Look, guys, Donald Trump's
got to get to places,

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:56.601
and he needs your help.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:59.300
If you can find it
in your heart to donate --

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.868
just $200,000, $300,000 --

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:04.367
it'll go a long way.

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.801
Wants everyone
to buy him a new plane.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:12.067
Buy him a new plane.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.267
-Yeah, he's got to get
a new plane.

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:15.400
-Meanwhile, President Biden

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.801
and several members
of his cabinet

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:19.300
are heading to Philadelphia
to join house Democrats

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.901
on their annual retreat.

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:22.501
It was supposed to be
in Vermont,

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:23.934
but they ran out of gas.

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:26.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.801 --> 00:01:28.400
Yeah, it's time for Democrats

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.367
to get together
for some bonding and fun.

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:31.767
And Nancy Pelosi is so excited,

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.734
she hasn't stopped rubbing
her knuckles all day.

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:35.234
[ Applause ]

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:37.434
-Many of you have been there.
-Yeah, yeah. Wow. There you go.

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:40.567
-Have been in and out of Iraq
and Afghanistan over 40 times.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:48.334
-But this is cool. The musical
guest for the retreat

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.701
is D.J. Jazzy Jeff.

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.100
Yeah, he's way better than
last year's entertainment --

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.100
chuck Schumer rapping.
This is real.

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.567
Okay. Very good. Thank you.

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:04.100
[ Applause ]

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.767
[ Laughs ]

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.000
Did you guys hear about this?

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.834
This is real,
and this is frightening.

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:12.968
Joro spiders.

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:14.901
Apparently,
there's some spider invasion

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.667
coming to the East Coast
in the spring.

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:19.167
Oh, yeah.

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:21.567
And scientists say they're
the size of a child's hand

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:23.734
and they can parachute
from the sky.

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:24.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.534
I love how scientists are like,

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:27.834
"How should we describe
the size?"

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:31.634
And they're like -- They
settled on "a child's hand."

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:34.033
-Wait, wait, wait.
That's crazy!

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:37.234
I can't believe these things
can parachute.

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:38.701
Look, I'm just gonna
lock myself

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:41.000
in my car
until this all blows over.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.167
-Oh, what kind of car
do you have?

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:46.534
-I actually just bought a BMW.
I'm pretty excited.

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:49.400
-You didn't hear
about the recall?

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.467
-Recall?
-Yeah.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.000
It's not good. Roll the clip.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.000
-A major recall of BMW.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.734
More than 900,000 cars and SUVs
have a problem.

00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:01.734
The engines can catch fire.

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:05.167
-Catch fire?!
Man, I just bought mine!

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:08.234
-I'm sorry about that, Tariq.
-It's fine.

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:11.434
I shouldn't be driving
on the road anyway.

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.767
There's supposed to be
a snowstorm this weekend.

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:18.267
Which is why I have
my trusty snowmobile.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.701
-Oh.

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.667
-Oh, what?
-Roll the clip.

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:27.167
-An important
snowmobile safety recall.

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:29.133
The machines affected
and the problem

00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:31.501
that could leave your sled
in flames.

00:03:31.501 --> 00:03:33.033
-[ Applause ]
-Come on!

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:35.133
Why is everything
catching on fire?!

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.100
-Yeah, tough break.
I'm so sorry, Tariq.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.868
-It's fine!
I should walk more anyway.

00:03:40.868 --> 00:03:42.968
Maybe I'll try
to get some steps in

00:03:42.968 --> 00:03:46.467
on my new Fitbit Ionic
smartwatch.

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.234
-Customers should
immediately stop using

00:03:48.234 --> 00:03:50.367
the Fitbit Ionic smartwatch.

00:03:50.367 --> 00:03:54.734
There's been several reports of
the battery burning customers.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.934
-What -- This is going to
ruin my workouts, man!

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:59.167
At least I can still
get some protein

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:03.033
by eating beef-jerky products.

00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:07.000
-Over 1,600 pounds
of beef-jerky products

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.033
have been recalled.

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:10.601
-What next? You gonna tell me

00:04:10.601 --> 00:04:14.767
I can't eat my Great Value brand
tortilla chips?

00:04:14.767 --> 00:04:16.567
-A Walmart recall is in effect

00:04:16.567 --> 00:04:19.834
for the Great Value brand
tortilla chips.

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.934
-I'm done. That's it. That's it.

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:24.100
-Tariq Trotter, everybody.
We can talk about this.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.501
Tariq Trotter.
We can figure it out.

00:04:26.501 --> 00:04:28.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.167
So sorry. Unfortunate.

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:33.501
-Wow. That's a lot of bad luck.
-Unfortunate, yeah.

00:04:33.501 --> 00:04:35.567
Got some business news.

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:38.767
I heard that Kohl's no longer
wants to be a department store

00:04:38.767 --> 00:04:43.367
and is turning itself
into a lifestyle brand.

00:04:43.367 --> 00:04:45.934
Meanwhile, T.J.Maxx is sticking
with their business plan --

00:04:45.934 --> 00:04:48.033
half clothing store,
half fight club.

00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.968 --> 00:04:51.467
"Give me that!"

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:53.334
"It's not even my size.
Who cares?!"

00:04:53.334 --> 00:04:55.534
[ Laughter ]
And this is fun.

00:04:55.534 --> 00:04:58.734
Disney just gave a first look
at Tom Hanks as "Geppetto"

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:01.033
in the live action remake
of "Pinocchio."

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:02.834
Here he is.

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:05.534
Yeah. You know Wilson
the volleyball saw that puppet

00:05:05.534 --> 00:05:08.501
and was like,
"Who the hell is he?"

00:05:08.501 --> 00:05:10.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.968 --> 00:05:15.934
Get this. I read an article
that said before Jeff Bezos

00:05:15.934 --> 00:05:17.834
took his big spaceflight
last year,

00:05:17.834 --> 00:05:21.868
he was so upset about how his
jumpsuit fit around his crotch

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:24.200
that he flew his tailor in
to fix it.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:29.968
I mean, you know...

00:05:29.968 --> 00:05:32.567
There's rich and there's
personal crotch tailor rich.

00:05:32.567 --> 00:05:34.667
-Right.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.467
Wow.

00:05:36.534 --> 00:05:38.834
-Wow!

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:41.067
[ Applause ]

00:05:41.067 --> 00:05:43.067
That's nuts.
-Yeah.

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:46.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.767
Speaking --
Finally, speaking of crotches --

00:05:48.767 --> 00:05:52.133
Uh.

00:05:52.133 --> 00:05:53.467
I don't think
I've ever said that.

00:05:53.467 --> 00:05:57.033
-Wow. Really?
-I've never said that.

00:05:57.033 --> 00:06:00.501
Speaking of crotches,
this is a crazy story.

00:06:00.501 --> 00:06:04.834
The crotch on a statue of
soccer star Cristiano Ronaldo

00:06:04.834 --> 00:06:08.033
is wearing away because tourists
won't stop rubbing it.

00:06:08.033 --> 00:06:09.667
-[ Laughter ]
-This is real.

00:06:09.667 --> 00:06:11.200
Take a look at this thing.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.567
And there's -- Yeah.
So it's -- There it is.

00:06:14.567 --> 00:06:16.100
Not good. Not good.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.067
A few people have spoken out
about the whole thing,

00:06:18.067 --> 00:06:20.634
including the statue itself.

00:06:20.634 --> 00:06:22.067
Check this out. It said...

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:29.400
Then an old rejected statue
of Ronaldo spoke up and said...

00:06:35.667 --> 00:06:37.667
Then the newer statue said...

00:06:41.701 --> 00:06:43.934
Then the rejected
Ronaldo statue was like...

00:06:48.901 --> 00:06:51.501
Then this plaque of Elvis
Presley spoke up and said...

00:06:58.501 --> 00:07:00.601
Then the statue of
Lucille Ball said...

00:07:05.467 --> 00:07:10.534
And finally this wax statue...
of Robert Pattinson said...

00:07:13.501 --> 00:07:15.467
There you go.
We have a great show.

